WEBVTT

00:13.810 --> 00:18.380
<i>Last Episode: Grand Finale,
Fading is the Beautiful Illusory Night</i>

00:19.720 --> 00:21.480
In a future to come...

00:21.820 --> 00:25.520
Ten years after the
Tragedy of Bashtarle...

00:25.730 --> 00:28.560
mankind is once
again terrorized by the...

00:28.660 --> 00:30.820
global energy nullification phenomenon!

00:36.040 --> 00:40.060
Now, with all of the Shizuma
Drives no longer working...

00:40.340 --> 00:44.870
Mankind has lost the
ability to move, see or hear...

00:44.980 --> 00:46.880
and all of their
lifelines have been lost.

00:47.250 --> 00:51.620
Helpless, they're about to endure
their seventh night of darkness.

00:52.390 --> 00:54.410
At this time, at Ryozanpaku...

00:54.520 --> 00:57.920
the battle between the Experts of
Justice and the BF Group rages over...

00:58.020 --> 01:00.500
control of the third sample
that could not only make the...

01:00.590 --> 01:04.400
Earth stand still, but could also
eradicate all air from the planet's surface!

01:06.170 --> 01:09.530
And elsewhere, beneath the veil
of secrets from ten years past...

01:09.670 --> 01:14.700
the vengeful Genya, otherwise
known as Emmanuel Von Vogler...

01:14.940 --> 01:19.940
arrives at Saint Abbe, in the
place once known as Bashtarle!

01:22.580 --> 01:23.950
However!

01:26.090 --> 01:27.090
What?

01:28.560 --> 01:30.150
Come on then!

01:32.630 --> 01:34.120
Wait! Isn't that...

01:34.930 --> 01:38.990
One of the Celestial Nine of
Ryozanpaku, the "Human Bomb."

01:39.170 --> 01:41.260
Is it Chujo the Silent?

01:41.370 --> 01:42.500
That's right!

01:42.700 --> 01:45.230
And this attack, one that
comes at the cost of my life...

01:45.340 --> 01:48.640
is the most powerful explosive
attack on Earth, my Big Bang Punch!

01:49.010 --> 01:51.270
So this is the "Forbidden
Technique" of rumor...

01:51.750 --> 01:53.080
That's right.

01:53.350 --> 01:55.870
And tonight, I shall use it.

01:56.550 --> 02:00.280
I am not the only one who has used
a doubled-edged blade as of late...

02:00.450 --> 02:06.320
Yes, Ginrei, Taiso,
Youshi and even Daisaku.

02:06.460 --> 02:08.720
Everyone has battled with themselves.

02:09.030 --> 02:14.130
But as their commander I
could do nothing but watch!

02:14.330 --> 02:17.930
I could do nothing for
them as their friend!

02:19.170 --> 02:22.040
And that angers me more
than anything else I've had to do!

02:28.450 --> 02:29.810
Is he planning to die?

02:29.950 --> 02:31.010
That's right!

02:31.750 --> 02:35.550
I'm sick of all the sacrifices
that have had to be made!

02:36.720 --> 02:38.520
Then please stop, Commander!

02:42.660 --> 02:43.790
Retreat!

02:47.870 --> 02:48.870
Ginrei...

02:54.140 --> 02:55.160
Curse it all!

02:55.280 --> 02:57.240
To be caught up in this!

02:57.980 --> 02:58.980
Doki!

03:12.230 --> 03:13.590
We're all right...

03:14.630 --> 03:15.630
But...

03:24.440 --> 03:26.370
For that power to be this strong...

03:27.240 --> 03:29.440
To say I'm surprised
would be an understatement.

03:31.680 --> 03:34.710
R-Red, help me...

03:37.850 --> 03:39.050
Sure, hold on.

03:39.220 --> 03:42.880
Impossible! How could she...

03:45.730 --> 03:47.280
W-What?

03:48.930 --> 03:51.960
Even one of the Ten has his limits.

03:52.730 --> 03:55.330
You don't want to live
with this shame, do you?

03:55.440 --> 03:57.100
Let me help you.

03:57.870 --> 03:59.840
W-Why you...

04:01.710 --> 04:02.730
Let's go Doki!

04:02.910 --> 04:04.900
D-Damn you...

04:23.760 --> 04:24.960
W-What is this?

04:30.840 --> 04:34.540
Looks like all the players have arrived.

04:35.410 --> 04:41.810
Then let my true Still Earth
Operation finally begin!

04:51.520 --> 04:52.960
H-How can this be happening?

04:53.790 --> 04:55.230
That's Ryozanpaku!

05:03.340 --> 05:05.810
Thank you, Daisaku.

05:07.010 --> 05:10.340
Because of you, I've been
able to make a decision...

05:10.440 --> 05:14.880
Yes... It's the power that I've
hesitated about using until now...

05:15.080 --> 05:16.710
I know that this is the time...

05:17.220 --> 05:18.220
Huh?

05:18.490 --> 05:22.550
Because I believe in my father...

05:23.060 --> 05:24.490
I love him...

05:25.960 --> 05:27.590
the same way you do...

05:28.230 --> 05:29.700
G-Ginrei...

05:30.630 --> 05:33.000
Say, do you remember?

05:33.600 --> 05:37.900
When you told me about
what your father had said...

05:38.410 --> 05:41.500
"Can a new age be attained
without unhappiness?"

05:42.240 --> 05:46.110
"And can happiness be attained
without sacrifices?" Do you remember?

05:47.680 --> 05:49.340
That answer...

05:54.850 --> 05:56.790
I think you can find it.

05:58.790 --> 06:01.790
And when you do, please tell me.

06:03.500 --> 06:04.620
Ginrei?

06:05.000 --> 06:06.260
Ginrei!

06:09.440 --> 06:10.530
Ginrei!

06:34.530 --> 06:36.790
W-What have you done?

06:37.430 --> 06:39.420
Don't you realize it, Farmelle?

06:40.030 --> 06:41.930
If you do such a large-scale teleport...

06:42.040 --> 06:44.730
the price you will have
to pay for such a feat is...

06:45.340 --> 06:46.740
Even so...

06:48.140 --> 06:49.230
Even so...

06:51.180 --> 06:52.660
It's the same thing all over again...

06:53.050 --> 06:56.640
As it was on that day, ten years ago.

06:57.180 --> 07:01.180
And again, am I only allowed to observe?

07:01.320 --> 07:02.650
Is that it, Professor Vogler?

07:03.920 --> 07:04.980
Professor!

07:06.460 --> 07:07.460
This place?

07:07.960 --> 07:09.360
It's Saint Abbe!

07:09.860 --> 07:10.860
And...

07:13.430 --> 07:14.590
Giant Robo!

07:20.970 --> 07:23.470
This time, we can win!

07:23.940 --> 07:25.540
We can beat that Giant Sphere!

07:42.960 --> 07:46.400
The Giant Sphere has even
suffered some damage...

07:47.670 --> 07:48.500
Damn it!

07:48.640 --> 07:51.100
I'll switch over to the sub-system!

07:59.950 --> 08:01.140
It couldn't be...

08:03.450 --> 08:04.250
Hurry!

08:04.350 --> 08:05.680
Do not delay!

08:05.820 --> 08:08.880
If you are able bodied, rescue
anyone and anything that needs help!

08:09.360 --> 08:10.820
This place will collapse!

08:10.960 --> 08:14.860
Sobikatsu, Ryotoja! Carry
our flag and make a formation!

08:15.400 --> 08:16.190
That's right!

08:16.300 --> 08:19.230
Now, while the Giant
Sphere is still stopped!

08:23.700 --> 08:25.100
Are you all right?

08:25.640 --> 08:26.370
Yes...

08:26.510 --> 08:28.200
But we need to...

08:28.540 --> 08:29.340
Right!

08:29.440 --> 08:30.880
Understood!

08:32.580 --> 08:33.670
Professor!

08:33.910 --> 08:35.880
Is Professor Go here?

08:36.220 --> 08:37.240
Master Kaei!

08:37.350 --> 08:39.620
Here! He's over here!

08:39.820 --> 08:41.410
The Gen Brothers!

08:46.890 --> 08:47.890
What is this?

08:54.770 --> 08:57.640
Gen Shoji, what is the meaning of this?

08:57.800 --> 08:59.740
What do you plan to do with Robo?

08:59.840 --> 09:01.430
W-Well...

09:01.710 --> 09:02.900
I won't do it!

09:04.080 --> 09:05.080
That's...

09:05.880 --> 09:08.750
Why does it have to be this way?

09:09.220 --> 09:11.380
Can you explain it to me, Professor Go?

09:12.420 --> 09:14.440
I'm sorry Daisaku...

09:14.720 --> 09:17.850
It's true that Robo was
defeated once in Shanghai...

09:17.990 --> 09:20.760
and we realize the danger now.

09:20.860 --> 09:25.320
But regardless of the fact that
Robo is powered by nuclear energy...

09:25.600 --> 09:27.930
That's not what I'm asking!

09:29.340 --> 09:32.460
Why aren't we trying to rescue Ginrei?

09:32.810 --> 09:36.470
Is it because Ginrei is trying to
bring all three samples together?

09:37.010 --> 09:38.310
W-Well that's...

09:38.540 --> 09:41.610
I don't know if she took
the sample with her or not!

09:41.750 --> 09:46.650
But besides that, how can
we leave her behind to go fight?

09:48.920 --> 09:50.620
I can't...

09:51.660 --> 09:53.990
You can't what?

09:54.130 --> 09:55.130
Say it!

10:00.830 --> 10:02.600
What are you doing, Koshin?

10:02.770 --> 10:03.770
Shut up!

10:03.940 --> 10:05.060
The rest of you, keep quiet!

10:05.710 --> 10:08.870
There's one way to deal
with brats who won't listen!

10:09.180 --> 10:10.180
But...

10:10.340 --> 10:12.210
You should know better, Professor!

10:12.510 --> 10:14.480
Why don't you answer him honestly?

10:15.180 --> 10:17.340
The fact that it's too late for her!

10:19.590 --> 10:20.880
That's right...

10:21.090 --> 10:22.110
Think about it.

10:23.620 --> 10:26.560
She initiated this gigantic teleport...

10:27.630 --> 10:31.590
I'm sure you've heard already,
but the price she has to pay is...

10:34.130 --> 10:36.800
It is the destiny that
awaits all teleporters...

10:39.010 --> 10:41.240
There's nothing we can do for her...

10:42.510 --> 10:43.510
Even so...

10:47.510 --> 10:52.080
You've come this far, as if
beckoned by your long dead father...

10:52.550 --> 10:55.990
I would like to see you go a bit further.

10:56.160 --> 10:57.160
And then...

10:57.520 --> 11:00.080
after your reunion with your brother...

11:00.390 --> 11:03.300
and when all three
samples are brought together...

11:03.430 --> 11:07.160
only then will the true
purpose of this operation be clear.

11:07.930 --> 11:13.030
This could only be made possible
by the plan of a master tactician.

11:15.640 --> 11:19.200
It would seem that even
the fates have sided with me.

11:23.550 --> 11:25.880
Do you understand now?

11:26.450 --> 11:28.650
There is no going back!

11:29.390 --> 11:32.120
Having regrets now will help no one!

11:32.530 --> 11:33.530
Yes...

11:33.690 --> 11:36.630
No matter what the truth may be...

11:37.700 --> 11:43.160
What we have to do now is
completely destroy that Giant Sphere!

11:43.570 --> 11:45.130
Then do it on your own!

11:46.240 --> 11:47.430
I want no part of it!

11:47.970 --> 11:49.500
Why do you still persist...

11:49.640 --> 11:50.470
Stop!

11:50.580 --> 11:51.870
He's only a child!

11:51.980 --> 11:52.710
Silence!

11:52.810 --> 11:54.940
Then why even have Giant Robo?

11:55.750 --> 11:57.340
Is it a toy?

11:57.580 --> 12:01.920
Did Professor Kusama
give it to a child to play with?

12:02.560 --> 12:04.990
But Robo can only be controlled by Daisaku.

12:05.430 --> 12:06.450
You know that!

12:06.760 --> 12:11.220
Then we'll force him to use
his power in the proper manner!

12:11.830 --> 12:15.860
But I'm sure my father didn't
want Robo used this way!

12:16.270 --> 12:20.600
He said to me, "Is
sacrifice really necessary?"

12:25.040 --> 12:28.410
And I still don't have an answer for that.

12:29.480 --> 12:35.510
But I think it's wrong to throw away
your life like Mr. Murasame does!

12:40.430 --> 12:41.950
Is that so?

12:42.400 --> 12:43.490
But...

12:43.900 --> 12:49.270
do you know that Murasame
is the one who suffered the most?

12:49.670 --> 12:50.300
Huh?

12:50.670 --> 12:51.670
That's right.

12:52.070 --> 12:55.870
Can you imagine what he went
through to put Ginrei in that Stasis Unit?

12:56.110 --> 12:57.800
You can't, can you?

12:58.480 --> 12:59.480
Don't move!

13:07.050 --> 13:09.080
It's a resonance barrier.

13:09.490 --> 13:10.620
You can't get close to it.

13:12.560 --> 13:14.620
But I did come all this way.

13:16.600 --> 13:19.120
No need to worry about me...

13:19.400 --> 13:23.100
When I realized the Giant
Sphere's weakness in Paris...

13:23.340 --> 13:25.700
I knew it would come to this...

13:30.310 --> 13:34.470
But I didn't want you to use
your teleportation ability...

13:41.090 --> 13:43.366
And after everything that happened,
I wasn't about to let you go.

13:43.390 --> 13:47.120
When I thinking about that, I found
myself teleporting out right here.

13:47.260 --> 13:48.260
Kenji...

13:48.690 --> 13:53.890
But like always, Farmelle, I'm on
this side and you're on that side...

13:55.570 --> 13:56.570
Kenji!

13:56.640 --> 13:59.660
Don't worry. I'm a man who can't die.

13:59.940 --> 14:01.460
I'll be back.

14:02.780 --> 14:06.010
Although I think Daisaku
really hates me now...

14:08.610 --> 14:12.750
You were the only one who
understood the pain of being immortal...

14:14.320 --> 14:15.320
Thanks for that...

14:17.220 --> 14:18.280
Kenji!

14:24.260 --> 14:25.320
Now hurry.

14:25.730 --> 14:27.200
The cockpit is right above!

14:27.370 --> 14:29.800
Take that sample and
do what you believe in!

14:30.440 --> 14:30.730
Yes!

14:31.240 --> 14:33.800
Have faith in yourself.
You're not wrong.

14:34.240 --> 14:35.240
Yes!

14:35.810 --> 14:37.240
We'll meet again!

14:37.810 --> 14:41.510
When I can finally die,
if that day ever comes...

14:57.560 --> 14:58.900
Kenji...

15:11.440 --> 15:14.510
Listen, each of us has done what we could.

15:14.680 --> 15:17.780
If you can't understand that,
then just go do whatever you want!

15:18.620 --> 15:20.880
However, regardless of the circumstances...

15:21.020 --> 15:25.290
you chose to become a member of the
International Police Organization...

15:25.660 --> 15:26.660
Therefore!

15:29.860 --> 15:31.760
You are not allowed to run from this place!

15:35.230 --> 15:38.600
If at any point, you
step away from this line...

15:39.110 --> 15:41.840
even if you are a
child, I will show no mercy!

15:45.580 --> 15:50.380
Just stand there and contemplate
your father's words all you want!

15:51.280 --> 15:52.280
Let's go!

15:54.050 --> 15:56.610
We've no choice but to
defend Abbe on our own!

15:56.920 --> 15:58.410
But how do we do that?

15:58.560 --> 15:59.620
Stop dawdling!

16:00.930 --> 16:01.950
Take your positions!

16:02.090 --> 16:03.090
Roger!

16:05.670 --> 16:08.730
Wait, how are we going
to fight without Robo?

16:08.830 --> 16:11.170
I have no idea! I'll leave it all to luck!

16:11.340 --> 16:13.740
Oh come on, give me a break!

16:14.340 --> 16:15.970
Professor Go, come on!

16:16.280 --> 16:18.710
We're certainly going
to need you for this one!

16:20.910 --> 16:21.910
But...

16:28.390 --> 16:29.720
I...

16:34.730 --> 16:37.130
So, it's about to begin.

16:37.430 --> 16:40.590
But how about you join me down here?

16:42.130 --> 16:45.570
No need for you to be
sneaking a peek from up there...

16:45.710 --> 16:48.070
Hanzui, the King of Confusion.

16:49.980 --> 16:52.570
I have to hand it to the
leader of the Magnificent Ten...

16:52.710 --> 16:55.050
for Master Achilles'
prison not to work...

16:56.020 --> 16:57.240
What do you know?

16:57.550 --> 16:58.550
Listen!

16:58.680 --> 17:04.150
Zangetsu, Yuuki, Old man
Kawarazaki, and even Jujoji!

17:07.290 --> 17:11.590
Because our opponents were Garuda,
Neptune and our leader's elite guards...

17:11.800 --> 17:14.130
we didn't resist at all.

17:15.230 --> 17:18.070
But had we the inclination, we
could have escaped at any time!

17:19.870 --> 17:24.040
Oh, I'm quite aware of what
the Magnificent Ten can do.

17:24.240 --> 17:27.680
That's why I'd like you to
remain quiet and observe.

17:28.050 --> 17:29.570
I don't need you to tell me that!

17:30.620 --> 17:32.710
That is all well and good.

17:33.220 --> 17:34.980
Master Achilles?

17:45.970 --> 17:47.700
My friends, just a bit longer.

17:47.830 --> 17:50.200
Is something the matter, Master Hanzui?

17:55.370 --> 17:57.840
The show is only beginning.

17:59.210 --> 18:03.110
Yes, this is only the beginning
of the destruction to come!

18:05.120 --> 18:07.750
Priority 2 Alert! Priority 2 Alert!

18:08.020 --> 18:11.480
All technicians below Level 4, evacuate
immediately to the nearest shelter!

18:11.920 --> 18:14.990
Priority 2 Alert! Priority 2 Alert!

18:15.730 --> 18:16.560
Hurry!

18:16.660 --> 18:18.720
Begin sealing off the
red residence zones first!

18:19.370 --> 18:21.730
Factories and Plants
initiate from Area Number 3!

18:22.540 --> 18:26.500
All surface level rescue crews leave your
posts and head directly to the shelter!

18:27.110 --> 18:29.510
We will be instituting
Special Defense Status!

18:29.610 --> 18:32.010
Activate all shields
and secure all hatches!

18:32.380 --> 18:35.510
I repeat, activate all shields
and secure all hatches!

18:35.950 --> 18:39.410
Saint Abbe, Proceed with Emergency
Evacuation Procedures at Rank Omega!

18:39.520 --> 18:40.250
All right!

18:40.520 --> 18:43.790
The Giant Sphere has increased speed
and is approaching from Sector 001!

18:43.890 --> 18:46.020
It will reach us in 8
minutes and 25 seconds.

18:46.290 --> 18:47.350
We have to hurry!

18:47.830 --> 18:50.850
Activate Saint Abbe Main Reactor Core!

18:51.130 --> 18:51.760
Activate!

18:51.860 --> 18:52.350
Activate!

18:52.600 --> 18:53.620
Activate!

19:02.470 --> 19:06.100
Saint Abbe Power Plant, all anti-Giant
Sphere preparations are complete!

19:08.610 --> 19:13.180
The Commander is amazing,
his preparations are perfect...

19:13.650 --> 19:15.350
but still, this battle...

19:17.620 --> 19:20.350
The one true key to victory is Daisaku...

19:22.900 --> 19:24.120
You're the only one...

19:36.410 --> 19:38.470
What's the matter, Daisaku Kusama?

19:38.680 --> 19:41.940
Why are you just standing around, hmm?

19:42.650 --> 19:45.050
It seems that you've done
something with Robo...

19:45.150 --> 19:47.431
Given up because you've
realized that you cannot stop me?

19:47.590 --> 19:48.590
If so...

19:53.260 --> 19:54.260
Robo!

20:00.770 --> 20:03.530
You and I are in similar situations!

20:03.870 --> 20:08.670
I'd thought you would show more
backbone, but I guess I was wrong!

20:09.580 --> 20:11.670
You just stay there and watch!

20:12.280 --> 20:16.650
Watch me and see what it is to
fulfill the last wish of your own father!

20:17.080 --> 20:19.780
See how wonderful it can be!

20:20.220 --> 20:23.120
I'll do this for the both of us!

20:30.260 --> 20:33.320
Let's go to Saint Abbe!

20:33.930 --> 20:35.870
For ten years I have waited for this day!

20:35.970 --> 20:38.516
Suffering from shame, hiding from the
world, and dreaming the whole time...

20:38.540 --> 20:41.470
of the day when I would have my revenge!

20:41.840 --> 20:45.210
And now all will know the shame
and helplessness of my father...

20:45.440 --> 20:47.710
and how Franken Von Vogler felt!

20:48.910 --> 20:49.910
But I can't...

20:50.320 --> 20:51.440
You can't run!

20:52.220 --> 20:53.220
I can't fight...

20:53.520 --> 20:55.650
You can't do anything!
<i>I can't do anything!</i>

20:58.620 --> 21:01.990
And that was my plan all along!

21:03.300 --> 21:04.460
Take this!

21:24.350 --> 21:27.840
All the Shizuma power left in
this world! Disappear forever!

22:05.190 --> 22:06.350
This is it!

22:06.460 --> 22:07.950
This is what I wanted to see!

22:08.290 --> 22:11.530
The moment when this land,
which was remade to hide...

22:11.630 --> 22:13.946
the dirty events of the
past, is stripped of all pretense!

22:13.970 --> 22:16.960
The truth of what really
happened will be revealed!

22:17.370 --> 22:18.270
That's right!

22:18.370 --> 22:21.100
How dare they try to wipe out
the very existence of Bashtarle...

22:21.210 --> 22:23.440
from this Earth and claim forgiveness?

22:26.750 --> 22:29.040
This time, you truly will lose the light...

22:29.180 --> 22:32.240
and find yourselves surrounded
by the true darkness of night!

22:33.790 --> 22:34.790
Father!

22:34.820 --> 22:38.350
Can you see it? This beautiful night?

22:46.330 --> 22:51.530
Is this the sacrifice needed for happiness?

22:52.070 --> 22:54.800
The misfortune needed to reach a new era?

22:55.240 --> 22:56.240
But...

23:03.980 --> 23:06.350
H-How can you allow this?

23:06.620 --> 23:09.020
At this rate, no matter
what the outcome may be...

23:09.120 --> 23:12.850
it's not just the BF Group, Mankind's
very existence could be threatened!

23:13.490 --> 23:15.960
Do you realize what you're doing, Komei?

23:17.460 --> 23:20.490
Just think about it.

23:20.770 --> 23:24.200
Has not the ultimate goal of the BF
Group been the conquest of the world?

23:24.870 --> 23:30.280
And was not destruction only
a means to reach this goal?

23:30.710 --> 23:33.270
But what meaning could this all have?

23:42.590 --> 23:44.220
Cursed lapdog of Komei!

23:44.320 --> 23:45.950
Do you think you can defeat me?

23:46.860 --> 23:48.660
Please calm yourself.

23:49.830 --> 23:51.420
Don't you understand?

23:51.560 --> 23:55.090
Everything that is happening
is according to the plan.

23:55.730 --> 23:59.640
Because the one who came
up with this operation was...

24:00.440 --> 24:05.140
our leader, Big Fire himself!

24:05.840 --> 24:07.070
W-What?

24:14.220 --> 24:15.710
I-It can't be...

24:18.860 --> 24:21.730
Why? My master, Big Fire?

24:22.590 --> 24:23.720
Why?

24:28.900 --> 24:30.100
Now then...

24:31.040 --> 24:33.370
Have you finally accepted the situation?

24:33.510 --> 24:36.960
Then let us observe the grand
finale of this battle together.

24:37.180 --> 24:40.170
The end as brought on by those youths.

24:44.480 --> 24:46.540
What is going on here?

24:46.690 --> 24:49.250
Why have we been brought here?

24:49.990 --> 24:51.010
No...

24:52.420 --> 24:56.760
This has to be according
to Master Komei's plan.

24:56.930 --> 24:57.930
If so, then...

24:58.030 --> 25:01.990
Right! We were told to look in this
bag if the situation were to change...

25:06.440 --> 25:07.700
I see...

25:12.640 --> 25:15.550
For it to be over already...
That would be too easy...

25:16.180 --> 25:19.150
but the age of the
Shizuma Drive is now over!

25:24.390 --> 25:25.520
A barrier?

25:31.160 --> 25:33.660
So, Saint Abbe still
has some fight left in it!

25:33.770 --> 25:34.770
What?

25:41.540 --> 25:45.410
How are they generating so much
power within an Anti-Shizuma Field?

25:45.740 --> 25:46.740
C-Can it be?

25:48.250 --> 25:51.410
Thinking back, the solution was so simple.

25:52.080 --> 25:55.650
The truth was revealed to us
by Professor Shizuma back then!

25:56.560 --> 26:00.010
I'll put my life on the line
to make this atonement!

26:03.800 --> 26:06.990
The moment the Anti-Shizuma
Field manifests...

26:07.800 --> 26:11.600
a normal Shizuma Drive
goes through a chain-reaction...

26:11.770 --> 26:15.040
and emits a massive surge of energy!

26:17.680 --> 26:20.840
Therefore, by extracting that
energy before it overloads...

26:20.950 --> 26:25.940
and combining it with the Gen
Brothers' Resonance Ability...

26:26.080 --> 26:28.580
we can create a powerful energy barrier!

26:29.450 --> 26:31.580
Ideally we might have been able to...

26:31.690 --> 26:34.520
utilize this energy overload
from the entire power plant itself...

26:34.660 --> 26:37.530
but the best we can do is
try and protect the Central Core!

26:38.360 --> 26:40.260
So, Professor Go...

26:40.470 --> 26:45.800
I see you have survived the tragedy also.
That explains my sister's situation.

26:46.410 --> 26:47.810
Emanuel, why are you...

26:47.910 --> 26:48.910
Shut up!

26:49.270 --> 26:51.190
For not revealing the
truth about the tragedy...

26:51.240 --> 26:54.540
you are just as guilty as the
others, and must be punished!

26:55.680 --> 27:00.380
We shall see if your little ploy can
stand up to the power of these samples!

27:10.030 --> 27:12.190
What unbelievable power!

27:14.470 --> 27:16.700
Now, Abbe will fall!

27:22.370 --> 27:23.370
Oh no!

27:23.540 --> 27:26.210
Now I will crush every
one of you and finish this!

27:30.950 --> 27:35.940
You will see the folly of your ways
and die inside that false symbol of peace!

27:36.990 --> 27:38.350
Why you!

27:39.390 --> 27:40.390
W-What?

27:45.630 --> 27:47.390
What's happening?

27:51.870 --> 27:53.300
It stopped.

27:53.410 --> 27:56.600
And the chain-reaction of the
Shizuma Dives has normalized...

27:56.840 --> 27:57.970
Can it be...

28:00.410 --> 28:02.900
The Giant Sphere is being pushed back...

28:03.380 --> 28:04.980
How can this be?

28:06.320 --> 28:07.320
W-What?

28:13.930 --> 28:14.930
I-Impossible!

28:19.830 --> 28:22.060
Daisaku Kusama...

28:22.200 --> 28:23.500
Why you...

28:23.640 --> 28:24.900
I'm sorry...

28:26.840 --> 28:28.070
I'm sorry...

28:28.610 --> 28:31.410
Ginrei, I'm so sorry...

28:32.640 --> 28:38.080
I don't know what reason you
had to go into the Giant Sphere...

28:38.920 --> 28:40.480
But I have no choice!

28:40.620 --> 28:42.180
I can't leave things like this!

28:44.290 --> 28:45.450
Daisaku...

28:45.860 --> 28:47.790
This is wrong!

28:48.260 --> 28:49.960
This has to be some kind of mistake!

28:50.730 --> 28:54.670
I don't believe that Ginrei's father
would wish for all this to happen!

28:55.230 --> 28:57.730
Silence! What do you know?

29:03.740 --> 29:04.740
Robo!

29:10.120 --> 29:13.110
I don't know what the truth is!

29:13.620 --> 29:16.610
I don't know if sacrifice is
needed to find happiness!

29:16.820 --> 29:19.720
I can't come up with an answer for that!

29:20.930 --> 29:22.120
But Father...

29:22.660 --> 29:25.320
I'm going to do what I can!

29:26.100 --> 29:27.690
I'm going to fight the best I can!

29:28.200 --> 29:29.200
So...

29:29.500 --> 29:30.500
So...

29:30.770 --> 29:33.200
So watch over me, Father!

29:33.640 --> 29:37.370
Until I can find the
true answer for myself!

29:49.860 --> 29:52.550
D-Daisaku Kusama!

29:52.760 --> 29:54.920
Now, let's go! Robo...

29:55.530 --> 29:57.550
Giant Robo!

29:58.600 --> 30:01.430
Destroy it, Robo!

30:05.470 --> 30:08.370
Go, Robo!

30:16.480 --> 30:17.570
What power!

30:21.250 --> 30:25.280
Okay, switch the energy transfer
to Robo from hardwired to wireless!

30:33.930 --> 30:36.770
Resuming chain-reaction
energy transfer to Giant Robo!

30:36.940 --> 30:39.530
There's only a.03%
power loss in the transfer!

30:39.670 --> 30:40.670
Good!

30:40.970 --> 30:43.270
Go! Robo!

30:47.810 --> 30:50.480
Dammit! I will finish you this time!

31:04.200 --> 31:05.360
I'll electrify you!

31:08.830 --> 31:09.830
Keep going, Robo!

31:26.820 --> 31:28.410
G-Giant Robo!

31:32.890 --> 31:33.720
The eye!

31:33.890 --> 31:34.890
Aim for the eye!

31:38.600 --> 31:40.260
I'll turn you into a pile of scrap!

31:52.840 --> 31:56.710
Oh no! Is he planning to
do what he did back in Paris?

31:57.780 --> 31:59.440
At this point, I don't have a choice!

31:59.650 --> 32:02.880
I'll blow everything away
with a maximum output burst!

32:06.190 --> 32:07.250
Daisaku!

32:07.830 --> 32:09.490
Get away from there!

32:09.660 --> 32:12.460
There should be an entrance
to the shelter behind you!

32:12.560 --> 32:14.500
Get away from there now! Daisa...

32:19.270 --> 32:21.360
R-Robo...

32:29.210 --> 32:30.210
Robo...

32:32.950 --> 32:33.950
Robo is...

32:51.940 --> 32:52.940
Go!

33:02.850 --> 33:05.370
What do you think you're doing,
Daisaku?

33:06.080 --> 33:07.080
He can't be...

33:09.820 --> 33:10.950
Robo is...

33:11.190 --> 33:12.190
Robo is...

33:14.490 --> 33:15.820
Giant Robo is...

33:16.530 --> 33:18.550
Giant Robo is calling for me!

33:19.500 --> 33:22.590
Then I will have to
prepare a proper welcome...

33:27.070 --> 33:29.060
We are the Blood Wind Clan!

33:29.270 --> 33:31.370
Our blades do not choose their targets!

33:31.480 --> 33:33.570
When they shine, there
will be a sea of blood!

33:34.410 --> 33:35.810
Daisaku Kusama!

33:35.910 --> 33:38.980
By order of Master Komei,
you will be our prisoner!

33:41.920 --> 33:43.860
Now, come along willingly!

33:48.660 --> 33:49.660
Who dares?

33:51.630 --> 33:54.060
The arrows that vanquish evildoers are...

33:54.170 --> 33:56.190
loosed by the masterful
hands of Sho Riko!

33:56.330 --> 33:58.030
You need not flatter me, Chin San Zan!

33:58.570 --> 34:00.470
The two Masters of Ryozanpaku!

34:00.570 --> 34:03.060
We are Kaei and Koshin! Beware!

34:09.550 --> 34:11.680
You've endured much, Daisaku Kusama!

34:11.850 --> 34:14.510
I see the teachings of my master, Chogai...

34:14.650 --> 34:17.650
the Takuto Tenno, within you!

34:17.790 --> 34:22.490
He said, "To seek out the truth
gives it meaning and value!"

34:23.660 --> 34:26.530
I give you thanks on behalf
of all of us at Ryozanpaku!

34:27.100 --> 34:30.160
So Daisaku Kusama, leave them to us now!

34:32.100 --> 34:33.970
<i>Tsuikon Datsumei Ken!</i>

34:42.380 --> 34:43.380
Thank you so much!

34:43.820 --> 34:47.270
Curses! We cannot let a
single child escape our grip!

34:48.190 --> 34:49.880
Oh no you don't, Blood Wind Clan!

34:51.660 --> 34:54.100
If you place no value on your
lives, feel free to come at us!

34:54.390 --> 34:57.230
I am Shoji of the three Gen Brothers
from the fishing village of stone!

34:57.400 --> 34:58.400
I am Shogo!

34:58.760 --> 34:59.860
And I am Shoshichi!

35:00.630 --> 35:03.360
Our lives will be your shield!

35:09.440 --> 35:11.170
Why you!

35:11.410 --> 35:13.280
Men, spread out!

35:15.380 --> 35:17.280
Don't fall behind!

35:18.450 --> 35:21.540
Kaichin! Kaiho!

35:24.660 --> 35:26.490
I won't let my prey escape!

35:27.690 --> 35:29.850
No evil shall remain after our passage!

35:31.930 --> 35:34.490
If you do not flee, you shall be
hunted down in this very place!

35:34.570 --> 35:37.090
The time has come for all of us to fight!

35:37.700 --> 35:38.860
Yeah!

35:39.100 --> 35:41.900
Let the Bells of Victory Toll!

35:43.640 --> 35:45.470
Do not worry about us!

35:45.780 --> 35:48.110
The only direction for
you to go is forward!

35:59.420 --> 36:00.860
Thank you all for your help!

36:17.340 --> 36:18.340
What?

36:18.440 --> 36:19.440
Oh no!

36:19.910 --> 36:21.240
We have you now!

36:44.740 --> 36:45.740
Tetsugyu!

36:47.710 --> 36:51.670
Didn't I tell you that I'd
protect you from now on?

36:55.910 --> 36:57.680
All right! Good boy!

36:58.420 --> 36:59.510
Now go!

37:00.750 --> 37:02.220
Robo is waiting for you!

37:02.390 --> 37:03.390
Yes!

37:12.630 --> 37:14.660
All right! You're doing well!

37:15.470 --> 37:17.730
See? You're not alone!

37:19.370 --> 37:21.360
We're all with you.

37:22.040 --> 37:24.410
You're all with me...

37:24.580 --> 37:26.570
Together we fight!

37:27.080 --> 37:29.570
Robo!

37:30.320 --> 37:32.220
Come to me, my son!

37:45.860 --> 37:47.800
Now, let's stand up together!

37:48.000 --> 37:49.060
Fight together!

38:10.360 --> 38:12.290
Noisy insects!

38:31.280 --> 38:34.610
I see. Is that how you plan
to get past the Energy Field?

38:35.250 --> 38:37.110
What a pathetic last effort on your part!

38:37.520 --> 38:39.610
We shall see whose power is greater!

38:46.520 --> 38:49.020
W-What a massive chain-reaction!

38:49.590 --> 38:52.330
Even with Robo's power added to
the energy of the chain-reaction...

38:52.430 --> 38:53.960
it can't keep up?

38:58.070 --> 38:59.070
Commander?

38:59.540 --> 39:00.600
My apologies.

39:00.710 --> 39:05.670
Ginrei's teleport sent me
a vast distance from here.

39:05.780 --> 39:08.510
I had some trouble getting back.

39:09.010 --> 39:10.480
C-Commander!

39:10.880 --> 39:14.050
This will be our final stand!

39:14.550 --> 39:16.450
That's right! Don't falter, Robo!

39:16.620 --> 39:19.920
If you take one step back, we'll
never be able to get this close again!

39:22.260 --> 39:24.290
Please hang in there a bit longer!

39:24.760 --> 39:29.000
This is our last chance!

39:40.380 --> 39:41.380
Daisaku!

39:44.320 --> 39:45.840
Now vaporize!

39:47.420 --> 39:48.720
Do not laugh!

39:52.060 --> 39:53.320
W-What the...

39:56.890 --> 39:58.990
Something's generating a shockwave!

39:59.200 --> 40:00.670
It can't be!

40:00.870 --> 40:02.420
Oh, yes it can!

40:05.570 --> 40:06.570
What?

40:12.640 --> 40:14.410
It's good to see you alive...

40:14.710 --> 40:16.580
Alberto the Impact!

40:21.550 --> 40:23.250
Listen well, Genya...

40:23.520 --> 40:26.980
As a member of the Ten, I
had to accept the shame of...

40:27.090 --> 40:31.550
playing possum so that I
could have this opportunity!

40:32.500 --> 40:33.830
Now, what will you do, Komei?

40:33.970 --> 40:36.990
Alberto is injured and
knows nothing of your plans.

40:37.340 --> 40:39.100
Or is this still part of your calculations?

40:41.710 --> 40:43.440
He plans to die!

40:44.210 --> 40:47.270
Y-You think a mere shockwave
can stop the Giant Sphere?

40:47.450 --> 40:48.540
Silence!

40:48.980 --> 40:51.640
Don't underestimate the Magnificent Ten!

40:57.320 --> 41:00.590
Impossible! He absorbed the Energy Field?

41:05.960 --> 41:07.120
Listen kid...

41:07.500 --> 41:12.400
I'm not here to aid your cause, and
I certainly don't plan to be friends...

41:12.870 --> 41:14.960
but this operation...

41:15.110 --> 41:19.340
No matter what's really
behind it, I know one thing!

41:19.540 --> 41:22.010
The fate of the world will not be...

41:22.150 --> 41:25.120
decided by a young punk like him!

41:26.450 --> 41:28.890
The final victor will be decided...

41:28.990 --> 41:32.820
by the clash between the BF
Group and the IPO's Experts of Justice!

41:33.460 --> 41:34.550
Am I wrong?

41:34.830 --> 41:35.950
Am I?

41:36.330 --> 41:37.990
Am I?

41:39.360 --> 41:41.160
Right, Taiso?

42:06.120 --> 42:07.490
F-Fire, Giant Robo!

42:19.400 --> 42:21.070
S-Stop!

42:24.780 --> 42:25.780
Stop it!

42:37.620 --> 42:39.490
D-Did we do it, Koshin?

42:43.360 --> 42:45.060
Stop it...

42:46.030 --> 42:49.000
Please, stop it...

42:49.130 --> 42:50.130
No more...

42:52.340 --> 42:53.500
Daisaku!

42:54.670 --> 42:56.940
Snap out of it! Go rescue Ginrei!

42:57.380 --> 42:58.500
You can still make it!

42:59.640 --> 43:00.640
Okay!

43:07.850 --> 43:08.980
Why?

43:09.320 --> 43:12.780
Why does everyone get in my way...

43:13.420 --> 43:15.420
I'm so close to getting revenge!

43:15.530 --> 43:18.050
My father's last wish...

43:18.860 --> 43:22.560
I'm so close to finding a
decade's worth of redemption!

43:23.100 --> 43:26.800
That doesn't matter anymore, brother!

43:28.470 --> 43:31.870
Please! We still have time to start over!

43:32.380 --> 43:34.870
So I beg of you, please stop!

43:35.850 --> 43:37.180
Farmelle...

43:39.220 --> 43:41.910
So you've brought me the third sample!

43:42.190 --> 43:45.090
You're so right! With
that, we still have time!

43:46.790 --> 43:47.790
Now!

43:47.990 --> 43:48.390
No!

43:48.860 --> 43:49.860
What's wrong?

43:49.990 --> 43:50.990
Hand it over!

43:51.660 --> 43:53.290
No, brother!

43:53.730 --> 43:55.460
What are you saying?

43:55.570 --> 43:56.570
Give it to me!

43:57.340 --> 44:00.860
With all three, we can recreate
the Tragedy of Bashtarle!

44:01.240 --> 44:03.260
Isn't that why you came here?

44:05.440 --> 44:07.210
Think about it, Farmelle!

44:07.550 --> 44:09.780
We can fulfill father's
dying wish together!

44:10.080 --> 44:11.310
No, brother!

44:11.680 --> 44:13.550
I can't...

44:13.920 --> 44:15.550
Enough!

44:28.930 --> 44:30.730
Y-You...

44:31.470 --> 44:32.470
Brother...

44:33.470 --> 44:34.470
My brother...

44:34.910 --> 44:36.770
If it wasn't for this...

44:37.410 --> 44:38.410
What are you doing?

44:38.840 --> 44:41.970
Something I should have done sooner!

44:43.250 --> 44:45.740
This should have been
destroyed ten years ago!

44:47.520 --> 44:49.110
Don't do it!

45:04.770 --> 45:05.790
Farmelle...

45:13.240 --> 45:18.150
It's your fault...

45:18.420 --> 45:21.350
You should have just given this to me...

45:21.590 --> 45:24.080
You should've believed
in our father's words...

45:27.760 --> 45:32.360
But Farmelle, don't worry.
I won't let you go alone...

45:32.700 --> 45:36.430
Your brother will follow you with
this self-destruct device soon enough...

45:36.530 --> 45:39.530
As soon as I rid the world of
St. Abbe and the Shizuma Drive.

45:40.100 --> 45:41.870
Then I'll have nothing more to do...

45:43.640 --> 45:45.770
But now, all three samples are together!

45:49.280 --> 45:53.270
Observe! As I put an end to everything!

46:26.280 --> 46:28.180
Now, the illusory
night will be dispelled...

46:28.290 --> 46:31.480
and the true beautiful
night will surround us all!

46:34.460 --> 46:35.520
W-What?

46:36.130 --> 46:37.820
What is that light?

46:44.200 --> 46:45.200
That's...

47:15.200 --> 47:17.860
T-This is New York!
Respond! Please respond!

47:18.640 --> 47:22.130
The Shizuma Drives are working once again!

47:22.270 --> 47:24.470
What's happened? Please respond!

47:24.610 --> 47:26.600
What is to be our next course of action?

47:27.310 --> 47:29.870
What has happened?

47:31.080 --> 47:34.050
This is the BF Arctic Base, we
managed to survive with only...

47:34.150 --> 47:36.380
We are in the process of
restarting our power plant...

47:36.490 --> 47:38.420
We're currently 900
meters below the Pentagon.

47:38.520 --> 47:41.360
Due to the malfunction, we're taking
our Mole Mech back to the surface!

47:41.830 --> 47:45.660
This is the Lunar Base! The light!
The light has come back to Earth!

47:48.570 --> 47:51.800
What is happening?

47:53.400 --> 47:55.310
Emmanuel...

47:55.770 --> 47:57.300
Emmanuel...

47:58.310 --> 48:00.180
Emmanuel...

48:00.540 --> 48:02.600
Emmanuel...

48:03.580 --> 48:04.810
F-Father?

48:04.950 --> 48:09.050
Are you listening, Emmanuel?

48:12.160 --> 48:13.280
Emmanuel...

48:15.130 --> 48:16.250
Father!

48:16.790 --> 48:19.860
My son, thank you.

48:20.130 --> 48:27.700
If you are seeing this image, there
is no longer anything to worry about...

48:29.470 --> 48:31.340
Listen Emanuel...

48:31.440 --> 48:34.780
The Shizuma Drive you
brought me was incomplete.

48:34.950 --> 48:41.410
Had mankind continued to use it, the
results would have been catastrophic.

48:41.650 --> 48:44.320
I had to hurry...

48:44.460 --> 48:49.760
The system they came up with
produces a special molecule...

48:49.860 --> 48:54.490
a by-product they could
not predict with their theory.

48:54.870 --> 48:59.800
And if the buildup of this element were
to continue, say for about a decade...

48:59.940 --> 49:05.100
it would cause a fusion
reaction with Earth's atmosphere...

49:05.240 --> 49:09.480
and that would wipe
out all the air on the planet.

49:10.150 --> 49:14.110
Yes, the more mankind
uses and reuses this system...

49:14.250 --> 49:16.380
the greater the danger is for Earth.

49:17.320 --> 49:19.380
But we still have time.

49:21.360 --> 49:26.160
This modified sample can neutralize
the harmful effects of the Shizuma Drives.

49:26.260 --> 49:29.930
This is the answer I've
found in my simulations...

49:30.170 --> 49:34.800
and the data from the Tragedy itself!

49:34.910 --> 49:38.900
But do not begrudge Professor
Shizuma and the others...

49:39.040 --> 49:44.000
they too are scientists who take
this planet's energy crisis seriously...

49:44.350 --> 49:47.250
besides, it is all in the past.

49:47.750 --> 49:51.880
They probably could not
continue their research without...

49:52.020 --> 49:54.790
making me the scapegoat of the Tragedy.

49:56.730 --> 50:02.030
I knew it, Professor Vogler was still the
amazing scientist I knew ten years ago.

50:02.630 --> 50:05.630
But all I did was doubt that great man...

50:05.840 --> 50:09.600
Now this is all I can do...

50:09.740 --> 50:13.640
The only thing I still worry about
is your and Farmelle's welfare...

50:15.950 --> 50:20.680
I wish for you two to have a happy...

50:25.590 --> 50:29.250
P-Please, stop Shizuma...

50:30.630 --> 50:31.630
F-Father!

50:32.000 --> 50:33.460
Hang in there! Father!

50:33.960 --> 50:37.030
Stop Shizuma...

50:37.170 --> 50:39.400
Stop Shizuma!

50:47.680 --> 50:49.480
What have I done...

50:50.680 --> 50:53.580
I misunderstood Father's will...

50:55.220 --> 50:59.180
Father wanted to fix the
defective Shizuma Drive and...

50:59.590 --> 51:02.920
What have I been doing?

51:03.060 --> 51:04.960
What?

51:06.800 --> 51:09.820
What have I been doing
for the last ten years?

51:10.330 --> 51:12.060
What have I done?

51:13.200 --> 51:16.200
Why tell me all of this now?

51:16.340 --> 51:20.040
Why couldn't you tell me
what you wanted me to do?

51:21.880 --> 51:24.080
You just left me with this terrible thing!

51:24.210 --> 51:26.310
What was I supposed to do?

51:26.650 --> 51:27.650
Father!

51:27.720 --> 51:29.580
Answer me, father!

51:50.410 --> 51:51.640
Don't you agree?

51:51.840 --> 51:55.640
Having been left with
such a terrifying thing...

51:58.080 --> 51:59.570
What would you have done?

52:00.050 --> 52:01.070
Answer me!

52:01.650 --> 52:03.090
Giant Robo!

52:03.250 --> 52:06.220
No! Daisaku Kusama!

52:20.370 --> 52:25.670
He used his teleport ability to send
the Giant Sphere into outer space.

52:28.180 --> 52:31.550
For all the work you put
in, what a pathetic end!

52:36.850 --> 52:37.850
What?

52:40.560 --> 52:41.720
Master Achilles!

52:41.790 --> 52:44.280
Didn't Hanzui tell you that...

52:44.560 --> 52:47.290
had we wanted, we
could escape at any time?

52:52.470 --> 52:53.470
Komei!

52:53.900 --> 52:57.070
I guess this is a case where the
tactician was undone by his tactics!

53:03.080 --> 53:05.410
I figured as much!

53:07.620 --> 53:09.680
Now, for your failure and...

53:09.790 --> 53:12.420
using our master Big
Fire's image in this manner...

53:12.520 --> 53:15.050
How do you plan to take
responsibility for this?

53:18.830 --> 53:20.490
Answer me, Komei!

53:27.910 --> 53:29.270
What's so funny?

53:30.040 --> 53:31.410
"Failure" you say?

53:31.510 --> 53:32.770
By no means!

53:33.040 --> 53:35.600
You dare try and weasel out of this?

53:36.750 --> 53:38.410
Listen well!

53:38.620 --> 53:42.140
This operation was nothing but a means
to attain the BF Group's greatest desire!

53:42.820 --> 53:45.980
It was merely the
first step in our great...

53:48.230 --> 53:51.530
GR Operation!

53:51.730 --> 53:52.730
Can it be...

53:53.200 --> 53:58.130
Yes, and the countdown has finally begun.

54:15.550 --> 54:16.820
Take a look...

54:17.090 --> 54:19.720
It's a repeat of everything
we've been through...

54:20.560 --> 54:26.260
Yes, the future we seek
is always shining bright.

54:26.700 --> 54:31.660
And people desire happiness
and try to overcome misfortune...

54:31.770 --> 54:32.900
Commander...

54:33.000 --> 54:34.000
Hmm?

54:34.570 --> 54:38.870
If it's all right with you, I'd
like to take a little time off.

54:39.180 --> 54:43.580
I think working on making the
Shizuma Drive into something...

54:43.710 --> 54:48.810
even more complete is my duty
as the sole survivor of the Tragedy.

54:50.450 --> 54:53.580
The Peking Base will
be more the lonely for it...

54:55.930 --> 54:58.830
Are you crying again, Professor Go?

54:58.930 --> 55:00.360
Of course not!

55:00.500 --> 55:02.760
I am extremely happy!

55:03.130 --> 55:06.160
Because this time we might actually...

55:06.270 --> 55:11.000
be able to attain a beautiful
night that everyone will desire!

55:29.260 --> 55:30.730
Ginrei...

55:45.540 --> 55:52.040
With a greater mystery yet to be revealed,
the Still Earth Operation came to an end.

56:02.830 --> 56:06.790
However, no one knew that on
this very day, at the Tower of Babel...

56:06.960 --> 56:12.130
events were unfolding that would
lead to the final battle between...

56:12.300 --> 56:15.360
the BF Group and the
IPO's Experts of Justice!

56:20.110 --> 56:24.740
But within the fires of that
great battle would be seen...

56:24.850 --> 56:27.196
the young man who controls
the most powerful robot in the world!

56:27.220 --> 56:29.310
His name is Daisaku Kusama!

56:29.650 --> 56:31.680
Crush them! Giant Robo!

56:37.960 --> 56:44.830
<i>GIANT ROBO</i>

56:45.140 --> 56:49.970
<i>The Day the Earth Stood Still: The End</i>

56:50.370 --> 56:52.310
<i>However...</i>

56:52.410 --> 56:57.280
<i>the battle continues.</i>

58:54.630 --> 58:55.830
Brother...

58:56.770 --> 59:00.000
Do you see it? The lights...

59:00.740 --> 59:02.070
You're right...

59:02.770 --> 59:05.440
The Earth is once again moving.

59:06.540 --> 59:08.100
I'm glad...

59:08.750 --> 59:10.980
I truly am glad...

59:17.920 --> 59:22.550
<i>This movie is dedicated to
fathers and sons everywhere.</i>
